ng</h2></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 line-clamp-3 mb-6 flex-grow\">Kekompakan paripurna menembus target tertinggi.</p><div class=\"flex items-center text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand transition-colors mt-auto\">Lihat Layanan <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:border-brand/30 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-brand/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col h-full\" href=\"/layanan/bondowoso\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-red-50 flex items-center justify-center text-brand group-hover:bg-brand group-hover:text-white transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h2 class=\"font-display font-bold text-xl text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand transition-colors\">Bondowoso</h2></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 line-clamp-3 mb-6 flex-grow\">Penyusunan visi strategis top management retreat.</p><div class=\"flex items-center text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand transition-colors mt-auto\">Lihat Layanan <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"